---
source: tests/integration.rs
expression: stdout
---
logdelta templates  10 lines, 2 distinct templates

9  <TS> stdout F <IP> - - <*> <*> HTTP/<NUM>" <*> <*>
   e.g. 2:2024-03-02T08:15:01.223456012Z stdout F 10.244.1.5 - - "GET /healthz HTTP/1.1" 200 2
1  <TS> stdout F {"level":"info","msg":"server listening","addr":"<IP>"}
   e.g. 1:2024-03-02T08:15:00.123456789Z stdout F {"level":"info","msg":"server listening","addr":"0.0.0.0:8080"}
